{"resourceIdentifier":"3339","resourceName":"Yan’an Aerial Seeding Afforestation Project","description":"Yan’an Aerial Seeding Afforestation Project (hereafter 'The Project') is located in Yan’an City, Shaanxi Region, China. The project aims to increase the carbon sequestration and to contribute to local sustainable development through directly aerial seeding on the barren land and barren mountain. \r\nAerial seeding is a method of afforestation in which forest seeds or seed pellets are scattered on the woodlands (i.e., sown areas) by aircraft. Planting afforestation by airplane is a modern afforestation method, which has the advantages of high speed, high efficiency, saving labor and great effect. In the sparsely populated, inconvenient transportation, labor shortage of large areas of barren mountains, sand and cutting, afforestation by aerial seeding is an effective way to speed up afforestation.\r\n31,049.40 ha of forest is to be established by direct aerial seeding on barren land and barren mountain in Yan’an city, there are 2 species selected as designated sowing seed species, Platycladus orientalis (Giant cedar) and Pinus tabuliformis (China pine), which are all native species. The implementation of the project will generate GHG emission removals and improve the Yan’an local environment, about 3,703,054.05 ha enhance the capabilities of local communities and residents by providing them with relevant technical skills and training and increase local biodiversity as a result of establishing a forest of native trees.","location":{"latitude":36.746729,"longitude":109.315494},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-23","endExclusive":"2022-09-23","endInclusive":"2022-09-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3339"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"t